# The binary built at the repository root by `make build`. The leading slash
# anchors the pattern to the root: an unanchored "omakaiju" also matches the
# cmd/omakaiju source directory and would hide new files in the main package
# from git.
/omakaiju

# GoReleaser's build output.
dist/

*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
*.prof
*.log
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Local design notes. The tracked design document is the README: it is
# what users read on GitHub and in the release tarball, and it is checked
# against the code by the tests. These are scratch files kept out of the
# repository.
designdoc.md
omakaiju - TUI File Manager Design Document.md

